Lightpanda browser (Docker image only)
https://github.com/lightpanda-io/browser
License: GNU Affero General Public License v3.0

The Docker image ships an unmodified Lightpanda binary, copied from the
lightpanda/browser image pinned in the Dockerfile. Huntsman runs it as a
separate process and talks to it over the Chrome DevTools Protocol. Its
complete source code is available at the URL above.

